Given the following premises and a conclusion, determine whether the conclusion logically follows from the premises.

Premises:
(forall x (DigitalMedia(x) -> NOT AnalogMedia(x))) AND (forall x (PrintedText(x) -> AnalogMedia(x))) AND (forall x (StreamingService(x) -> DigitalMedia(x))) AND (forall x (HardcoverBook(x) -> PrintedText(x))) AND (StreamingService(1984) -> HardcoverBook(1984))

